@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
hide empty description

skinparam shadowing false

skinparam state {
    BackgroundColor #EAF3FF
    BorderColor #2F5597
    FontColor #1F1F1F
    FontSize 14
    RoundCorner 15
}

skinparam ArrowColor #2F5597
skinparam ArrowFontColor #1F1F1F

skinparam noteBackgroundColor transparent
skinparam noteBorderColor transparent
skinparam noteBackgroundColor<<Info>> #FFF2CC
skinparam noteBorderColor<<Info>> #2F5597
skinparam noteFontColor<<Info>> #1F1F1F

state "Inactive" as INACTIVE : main menu, navigator not in use
state "Selecting food court" as SELECTING_LOCATION : lists the food courts
state "Selecting stall" as SELECTING_STALL : lists the stalls of the chosen food court
state "Showing menu" as SHOWING_MENU : shows the items and prices of the chosen stall

[*] --> INACTIVE

INACTIVE --> SELECTING_LOCATION
note left on link
location
end note

SELECTING_LOCATION --> INACTIVE
note right on link
back
end note

SELECTING_LOCATION --> SELECTING_STALL
note left on link
valid number
end note

SELECTING_STALL --> SELECTING_LOCATION
note right on link
back
end note

SELECTING_STALL --> SHOWING_MENU
note left on link
valid number
end note

SHOWING_MENU --> SELECTING_STALL
note right on link
back
end note

SELECTING_LOCATION --> SELECTING_LOCATION : number out of range\n(error shown)
SELECTING_STALL --> SELECTING_STALL : number out of range\n(error shown)

note right of INACTIVE <<Info>>
From any state:

home:
return to Inactive

FOOD_COURT / STALL:
jump to Showing menu

Example:
PGPR / Chicken Rice
end note

@enduml
